  'festive-lights-switch-on-cbd-road-closures-2026-11-27',
  'Central Cape Town streets shut on Sunday for the Festive Lights Switch-On',
  'Traffic', '2026-11-27', 'Cape Town Etc', 'https://www.capetownetc.com/news/cape-town-festive-lights-switch-on-major-cbd-road-closures-expected-this-sunday/',
  'A string of CBD streets will be closed to traffic across Sunday 29 November, starting at 05:00, for the free Festive Lights Switch-On concert on the Grand Parade.',
  'The City of Cape Town says a number of central streets will be shut for the 57th Festive Lights Switch-On. Closures begin at 05:00 on Sunday, 29 November and end at the same hour on Monday, 30 November. Streets affected: Parliament, Parade, Longmarket, Darling, Corporation, Church, Buitenkant, Barrack and Adderley. One lane of Darling Street, on the stretch from Parade to Corporation, stays closed until Tuesday, 1 December while the stage is built.

Drivers may not stop in a separate set of streets from 16:00 on Saturday, 28 November through to midnight on Monday: Parliament, Parade, Longmarket, Corporation, Church, Buitenkant, Barrack and Adderley streets, and cars left there risk being towed.

The concert is free and is staged at City Hall on the Grand Parade, with more space to watch along Adderley Street. The event area opens to the public at 13:00 through 13 entry points, where security searches will be carried out. Alcohol, fireworks, weapons, umbrellas and gazebos are not allowed. Performers announced include Nasty C, Liquideep, Dee Koala and the duo Jazzwrld and Thukuthela. Time Out lists the event as running from 4pm to 10pm.

MyCiTi has adjusted some services for the evening. The D01 to Khayelitsha runs until 23:00, the T01 to Dunoon until 22:30, and Route 106 is rerouted along Strand Street and skips the Groote Kerk stop. The City says e-hailing drivers should use Darling Street outside the Castle of Good Hope or the corner of Strand and Adderley streets. Commuters should allow extra travel time and check the MyCiTi website for the full list of route changes.',
  NULL, NULL, NULL,
  '["https://www.capetownetc.com/news/cape-town-festive-lights-switch-on-major-cbd-road-closures-expected-this-sunday/", "https://www.timeout.com/cape-town/news/nasty-c-liquideep-and-more-cape-towns-festive-lights-switch-on-line-up-revealed-103026"]',
  'agent'
);
